# "At the beginning of your end step, if you're the monarch" (CR 603.4): Bot2 becomes the monarch on turn 2 with Emberwilde Captain, so on turn 3 Bot1 is not the monarch at its end step and the trigger does not
# happen, though an Ornithopter is in its graveyard (Bot1 Bolts its own, which also drains with Grave Venerations). Without a trigger there is no target question and the Ornithopter stays in the graveyard.

